<title>BELGIUM: Elephants in hot water.</title>
<headline>Elephants in hot water.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dumbo and Dora, who have daily sand baths and cold showers in the summer, have a pleasant surprise in store.</p>
<p>Antwerp Zoo, where the two elephants live, said on Wednesday it was installing solar panels to heat 2,000 litres of water a day and give its pachyderm lodgers a daily warm shower.</p>
